Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=10}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:35.95,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,好了，我還有些武士要收拾。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.95,0:01:41.08,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,不過在那之前，\N我該先把手邊的事辦完。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:46.75,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,鱷魚小姐，妳準備好\N把他的聲音傳遍全島了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:48.13,Main-207+,Caiman Lady,0,0,0,,準備好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:49.84,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,黑腳……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:53.26,Main-207+,Caiman Lady,0,0,0,,能否請你立刻\N把妮可·羅賓叫來？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:58.01,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,我們都準備就緒了……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.43,0:02:01.43,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,我在入口周圍\N佈下了層層蛛網。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.43,0:02:05.65,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,一旦碰到我這又黏又硬的膠絲，\N你就再也逃不掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:08.44,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,地板上我也塗了一層。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:10.40,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,只要踏錯一步，你就被困住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.82,0:02:17.12,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,除此之外，我的姑娘們\N還帶著麻醉槍在後方守著。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.53,0:02:20.87,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,剩下你要做的……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.13,0:02:29.96,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,就是把她叫出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.71,0:02:31.96,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,快叫妮可·羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.43,0:02:38.60,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,快點，向她求救啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.60,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,我還有別的事要辦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.23,0:02:45.23,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,羅賓……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.16,0:02:50.57,Flashbacks-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,我想……加入你們一夥。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.57,0:02:51.90,Flashbacks-207+,Straw Hats,0,0,0,,－咦？！\N－咦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:53.28,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:54.70,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:03:00.16,Flashbacks-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,我想活下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:06.62,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,你還真是頑固……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:11.55,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,快啊！快啊！快啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:13.38,Main-207+,Sanji Simp,0,0,0,,唉，我看不下去了……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:14.76,Main-207+,Sanji Simp,0,0,0,,我都要哭了……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.76,0:03:18.89,Main-207+,Sanji Simp,0,0,0,,那男人絕不讓朋友受到傷害！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.89,0:03:22.01,Main-207+,Sanji Simp,0,0,0,,他寧死也不肯吐露半個字！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:25.89,Main-207+,Sanji Simp,0,0,0,,若不是敵人，\N我恐怕都要愛上他了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:27.85,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,等……等等！
Comment: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:41.16,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Give me a chance to at least say a few words!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:37.99,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,給我一點時間……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.99,0:03:41.16,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,讓我說幾句話……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:47.42,Main-207+,Sanji Simp,0,0,0,,我猜他只是想在臨死前\N說句「去死吧」之類的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:48.54,Main-207+,Yamanba,0,0,0,,拜託別這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:52.00,Main-207+,Yamanba,0,0,0,,別再惹她生氣了，否則……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:54.01,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,羅賓……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:56.80,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我……我……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:57.80,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:04:02.51,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,好想……再看一次妳的笑容……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:13.40,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,救救我，羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.19,0:04:20.28,Main-207+,Ladies,0,0,0,,－什麼？！\N－什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:20.28,Main-207+,Sarahebi,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(960,131.3)}他終究還是向她求救了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:25.12,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\i1}我在三樓！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:27.96,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\i1}在宴會廳裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:29.75,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\i1}我被抓做人質了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:30.75,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\i1}對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:32.67,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,香吉士……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.13,0:04:37.59,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\i1}妳不來的話他們會殺了我，羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:40.64,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\i1}救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:44.64,Main-207+,Heat,0,0,0,,那是什麼鬼？真是遜斃了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:47.27,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,那是草帽一夥的人嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.27,0:04:51.40,Main-207+,Jinbe,0,0,0,,你聽！他的聲音響遍了整座島！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:59.24,Main-207+,Jinbe,0,0,0,,妮可·羅賓是世上最重要的人物之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:02.32,Main-207+,Jinbe,0,0,0,,他們一定是衝著她的知識來的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:09.12,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\i1}在我聽來這根本是衝著羅賓來的陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:12.71,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,一個大男人竟發出這麼窩囊的聲音！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:22.47,Main-207+,Marco,0,0,0,,這些傢伙真是笑死人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.47,0:05:25.14,Main-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,我敢打賭那絕對是個女人。
Comment: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:30.81,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}[Sanji Line]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:26.97,Main-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,真麻煩……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:30.81,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，娜美！他的聲音是從那上面傳來的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.81,0:05:32.02,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(960,131.3)\i1}小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:34.19,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,我剛才也看到一個那種東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:36.07,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,那隻眼睛是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:36.07,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(960,131.3)\i1}妳是我唯一的希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:37.69,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\i1}快點來！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:42.03,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:48.79,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,真是意外。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.46,0:05:56.54,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我把羅賓叫來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:58.63,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,快把我鬆綁。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:02.09,Main-207+,Sarahebi,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:06.05,Main-207+,Sarahebi,0,0,0,,夫人，有人來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:07.97,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,這麼快？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:10.85,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,你哪兒也別想去。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.02,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,咦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.02,0:06:14.73,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,你不是說愛我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.73,0:06:17.90,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,那這就不再是生意了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:19.44,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,現在是私事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:21.49,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,看到那些男孩了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.49,0:06:24.07,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,你會成為我珍愛的寵物之一，就像他們一樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:33.96,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,等我調教完，你就再也離不開我的撫摸了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:37.38,Main-207+,Prisoners,0,0,0,,{\q2}－我的心只屬於黑瑪麗亞夫人一人……\N－我的心只屬於黑瑪麗亞夫人一人……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:39.38,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\i1}我的{\i0}心……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:42.21,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,屬於{\i1}所有{\i0}的女士！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:44.76,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,我不准你對我不忠！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:46.18,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,你需要好好被調教一番！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:47.30,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:52.14,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我可不願傷害女士，\N所以我的武裝色霸氣手下留情了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:54.39,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}千紫萬紅！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:59.32,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}巨大手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:00.65,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,75)}打屁股！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:08.91,Main-207+,Caiman Lady,0,0,0,,黑瑪麗亞夫人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:21.30,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,妳是怎麼進來的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.05,0:07:25.93,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,我隨處都能綻放。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:30.51,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,妳竟敢打我的臉……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:36.44,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,妳真以為我會天真到\N直接踏進妳的陷阱？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:39.48,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.95,0:07:50.07,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,我曾長期待在各種邪惡的組織裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:54.00,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,當有人折磨我的朋友……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:07:56.16,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,我便按捺不住……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:07:59.25,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,心中的惡魔！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:06.51,Main-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,啊，失禮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.51,0:08:09.26,Main-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,我已用冥界的寒氣將你的束縛斬斷。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:11.97,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,布魯克！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:19.69,Main-207+,Yamanba,0,0,0,,小姐！他們把麻醉部隊解決掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:21.36,Main-207+,Sarahebi,0,0,0,,妳所有的蛛絲陷阱……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:23.52,Main-207+,Bishonure-Onna,0,0,0,,……也全被凍結粉碎了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:30.16,Main-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,看來蛛絲與冥界的寒氣\N還挺相配的呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:38.16,Main-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:39.75,Main-207+,Ladies,0,0,0,,－你們才是怪物吧！\N－你們才是怪物吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:42.42,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:44.13,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,妳救了我……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:46.00,Main-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,別放在心上。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:51.01,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,抱歉了，我得去幫錦右衛門他們一把！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:56.31,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,不知怎地，我實在覺得\N自己贏不了這一場！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.68,0:08:57.85,Main-207+,Robin+Brook,0,0,0,,－那還用說。\N－那還用說。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:08:59.64,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,給我回來，黑腳！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:01.65,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,你要成為我的寵物！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.65,0:09:02.90,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,我不會放你走！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:04.94,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,就這樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:11.28,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,還有什麼遺言嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:23.17,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,妳願意為一個會出賣朋友的男人赴死？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:26.00,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,不，黑瑪麗亞……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:28.84,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,看來妳並不明白……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:34.51,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,朋友究竟有多麼可貴。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.76,0:09:37.72,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:42.65,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,謝謝你依靠我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.65,0:09:44.15,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,這讓我很開心！
Comment: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:49.57,Main-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,Oh, it's frozen there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.77,0:09:47.73,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,啊，小心。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:49.49,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,地板結冰了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:56.03,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,哇、哇、哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:09:57.87,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.88,0:10:08.25,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,為什麼老鼠身上會冒煙？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:12.76,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,那是瑪麗之一，我父親軍隊裡的監視部隊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:13.80,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,是改造人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:17.85,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,換句話說，就是裝有機械身體部件的動物。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.85,0:10:19.10,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:23.44,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,牠們在島上漫無目的地遊蕩，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:26.94,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,但會把看到的一切分享給人類瑪麗！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:27.69,Main-207+,Shinobu+Momonosuke,0,0,0,,－什麼？！\N－什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:29.78,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,所以，就連這裡也……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:37.99,Main-207+,Goon #1,0,0,0,,喂，你確定是這間倉庫嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:41.45,Main-207+,Goon #2,0,0,0,,這地方被詛咒了，早就沒人進去過。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.87,0:10:45.42,Main-207+,Goon #3,0,0,0,,看起來沒人進去過。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:47.33,Main-207+,Goon #2,0,0,0,,可他們說就是這裡啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.33,0:10:49.21,Main-207+,Goon #1,0,0,0,,絕對錯不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.30,Main-207+,Goon #1,0,0,0,,大和少爺——
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:52.38,Main-207+,Goon #1,0,0,0,,我是說，下一任將軍就在裡面！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.43,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,聽起來人數不少。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.43,0:10:56.76,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,這裡已經不安全了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:58.68,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,我們得逃了，大和！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:11:02.14,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,請帶我們走一條\N不會讓桃之助大人被看見的路！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:06.69,Main-207+,Goon #1,0,0,0,,將軍！快出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:09.52,Main-207+,Goon #1,0,0,0,,不然我們就把門撞開！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:11.15,Main-207+,Goons,0,0,0,,－一、二！\N－一、二！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:15.45,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,他們要撞破門了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:17.03,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,抱歉了，桃之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:18.03,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:19.28,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,躲進我的衣服裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:20.78,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:21.87,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,什……什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.42,0:11:36.13,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,走吧，忍！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:38.84,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,我不是叫你別讓他被看見嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:41.76,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:44.14,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,不把他們全部打倒，他們就會看見他！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:50.15,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,我不是那個意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:51.82,Main-207+,Goons,0,0,0,,－可惡！\N－可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:59.62,Main-207+,Gifter #1,0,0,0,,我……我們給賦者已經封鎖這條路了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:01.83,Main-207+,Gifter #2,0,0,0,,妳現在實在不該逞強戰鬥的！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:03.29,Main-207+,Jack,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:04.87,Main-207+,Jack,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:07.00,Main-207+,Jack,0,0,0,,包紡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:10.50,Main-207+,Jack,0,0,0,,紅鞘武士還在寶物庫裡嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.13,0:12:20.14,Main-207+,Bao Huang,0,0,0,,是的，還在！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.14,0:12:22.89,Main-207+,Jack,0,0,0,,黑瑪麗亞！妳現在人在哪？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.31,0:12:25.60,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,我還在宴會廳。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.10,0:12:31.44,Main-207+,Jack,0,0,0,,好！那我去把那些武士解決掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:42.83,Main-207+,Jack,0,0,0,,就算他們命懸一線，\N飛六胞也絕不可能殺得了他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.70,Main-207+,Jack,0,0,0,,聽懂了嗎？！別插手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:48.79,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,傑克……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:52.54,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,你太小看我了……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.51,0:12:57.67,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,不過……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:01.22,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,這倒正合我意。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.31,0:13:11.44,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,有勞他替我把那事辦了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:17.03,Main-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,那到底……是什麼？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:22.49,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,聽好了，妮可·羅賓……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:26.20,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,妳很快就會歸總督凱多所有……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.49,0:13:28.95,Main-207+,Black Maria,0,0,0,,這是無可避免的。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:32.08,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,不必了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:34.29,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,我寧願死！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:36.31,Thoughts-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,好帥！
Comment: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:01.49,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,Lick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:05.87,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,你們已經盡力了，滿月戰士們！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:17.54,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,可惜天公不作美啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:25.39,Main-207+,Carrot,0,0,0,,{\t(689,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}佩特羅……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.06,0:14:30.43,Flashbacks-207+,Pedro (exploding),0,0,0,,聽好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:33.85,Flashbacks-207+,Pedro (exploding),0,0,0,,{\t(2190,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}你們-{\i0}gara{\i1}必須繼續前進！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:38.44,Main-207+,Carrot,0,0,0,,無論如何……我都要為佩特羅報仇……！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:43.95,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,為佩特羅報仇？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.95,0:14:47.24,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,那個沒用的蠢貨死有餘辜！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:54.62,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,{\q2}大搖大擺闖進大媽海賊團的地盤，\N你們是打算野餐嗎？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:15:00.50,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,{\q2}若不想害死同伴，\N何不滾回森林裡吃草去？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:10.51,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,在那兒舔傷口去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:14.85,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,好了……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.85,0:15:19.48,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,與百獸海賊團結盟，\N實在讓我提不起半點興致……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:22.90,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,但這是媽媽的決定，也就只好如此了……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:28.91,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,得讓這些小鬼明白，\N四皇根本不是他們惹得起的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.37,0:15:36.83,Main-207+,Bao Huang,0,0,0,,他們逃跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:40.84,Main-207+,Bao Huang,0,0,0,,敵方首領桃之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:43.30,Main-207+,Bao Huang,0,0,0,,正在遠離……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:46.38,Main-207+,Bao Huang,0,0,0,,禁忌倉庫！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.27,0:16:00.27,Main-207+,Bao Huang,0,0,0,,我目前看不到桃之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:03.07,Main-207+,Bao Huang,0,0,0,,但絕對錯不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:08.99,Main-207+,Bao Huang,0,0,0,,桃之助正和大和少爺\N以及{\i1}女忍者{\i0}在一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:24.00,Thoughts-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,雖然又擠又悶得難以呼吸，\N但不知為何……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:28.13,Thoughts-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我卻感覺自己彷彿身在天堂！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.31,0:16:37.89,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,忍，這邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.31,0:16:40.90,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,他們沒完沒了地冒出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:47.86,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,我們得找一條更不顯眼的路！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:49.45,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,別擔心！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:51.87,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,只要把他們全部解決，他們就看不到我們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:55.58,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,就跟你說了，我不是那個意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:02.54,Main-207+,Bao Huang,0,0,0,,{\i1}我再說一遍！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:06.96,Main-207+,Bao Huang,0,0,0,,{\i1}逃出禁忌倉庫的桃之助，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:11.18,Main-207+,Bao Huang,0,0,0,,{\i1}正和大和少爺以及{\i1}女忍者{\i0}在一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:12.59,Main-207+,Bao Huang,0,0,0,,千真萬確！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:15.14,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,又是廣播……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:17.27,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,他們要去追阿桃和忍！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:19.98,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,大和少爺？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:21.69,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,算了，管他的……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:25.23,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,喂，禁忌倉庫往哪走？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.23,0:17:26.98,Main-207+,Goon #4,0,0,0,,我……我才不會告訴你。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.07,0:17:28.94,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,咦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:34.95,Main-207+,Goon #4,0,0,0,,就……就在骷髏圓頂入口附近……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:39.91,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,錦右衛門他們在天守閣後方……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:43.46,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,那和圓頂入口正好是反方向。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:47.59,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,錦右衛門他們傷得很重……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:51.47,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,阿桃和忍正被那些該死的給賦者追著……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:53.84,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,哪一邊更需要我？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.35,0:17:57.35,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,這邊？！還是那邊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.89,0:18:03.94,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,沒時間多想了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.94,0:18:06.57,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,最需要我的人是在……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:08.47,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,絕對是這一邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:21.79,Main-207+,Kojuro,0,0,0,,我不行了……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:33.18,Main-207+,Kojuro,0,0,0,,這藍色的火焰在抽乾我的體力，可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.97,0:18:36.01,Main-207+,Kojuro,0,0,0,,我感覺自己……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:38.26,Main-207+,Kojuro,0,0,0,,快到極限了……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:45.44,Main-207+,Dotaku,0,0,0,,撐住！不然你會再次變成冰鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.44,0:18:50.28,Main-207+,Dotaku,0,0,0,,你會失控，耗盡剩餘的力氣，\N這次必死無疑！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.82,0:18:55.53,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,別放棄，年輕人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.91,0:18:58.24,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,振作起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:03.91,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,那隻狸貓正承受著和你一樣的痛苦，\N卻仍在拼命趕製解藥！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:07.29,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,我們豈能比他先放棄？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:10.30,Main-207+,Kojuro,0,0,0,,大……大老大……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:12.30,Main-207+,Kojuro,0,0,0,,您看起來不一樣了……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:18.47,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,交給老夫吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.85,0:19:24.35,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,是時候讓他們見識……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.35,0:19:27.19,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,武士的頑強了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:34.03,Main-207+,Goon #5,0,0,0,,亞普，我們打不下去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:39.57,Main-207+,Goon #5,0,0,0,,{\q2}抗體就在他們身後，\N可我們就是突破不了他們那銅牆鐵壁般的防守！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.57,0:19:44.16,Main-207+,Goon #6,0,0,0,,帥氣大人為什麼連我們也一起感染？！\N我們可是自己人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:48.04,Main-207+,Apoo,0,0,0,,你再怎麼哭天喊地，他也不會救你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:53.09,Main-207+,Apoo,0,0,0,,快把那隻狸貓宰了，把抗體弄到手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.05,0:19:55.13,Main-207+,Apoo,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.47,0:19:59.18,Main-207+,Apoo,0,0,0,,德雷克！那個叛徒！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:02.39,Main-207+,Apoo,0,0,0,,別再逞英雄了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:05.14,Main-207+,Daikoku,0,0,0,,有問題的不只德雷克！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.85,0:20:10.56,Main-207+,Daikoku,0,0,0,,那個乾癟的老頭子不知怎麼恢復了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:15.36,Main-207+,Daikoku,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,523)}和之國黑社會的傳奇老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:18.36,Main-207+,Daikoku,0,0,0,,「花」豹五郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:23.45,Main-207+,Daikoku,0,0,0,,有那兩個怪物鎮守著……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:28.00,Main-207+,Daikoku,0,0,0,,我們根本沒機會靠近那隻狸貓！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:30.54,Main-207+,Hanzo,0,0,0,,他怎麼變成那副模樣？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:33.34,Main-207+,Hanzo,0,0,0,,前一秒他還只是個瘦小的老頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:38.84,Main-207+,Hanzo,0,0,0,,他變回了當年凱多執意\N要招攬的那個魁梧巨漢！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:42.80,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,是興奮得發抖嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.51,0:20:44.47,Main-207+,Cho,0,0,0,,大老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.85,0:20:46.22,Main-207+,Cho,0,0,0,,您沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:48.10,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.81,0:20:51.56,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,老夫感到一陣寒意……然而……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.69,0:20:55.53,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,老夫仍對自己的意志深信不疑！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.82,0:21:00.82,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,想來是染上了這病毒……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:05.79,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,榨乾了老夫最後一絲力氣，\N使老夫瀕臨死亡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:10.79,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,事已至此……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:15.34,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,老夫要以僅剩的力量……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.01,0:21:24.01,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,縱使賠上性命……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.01,0:21:26.97,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,也要斬盡……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.35,0:21:31.48,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,敵方所有主力！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:36.61,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,喂！各位小老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:38.53,Main-207+,Underbosses,0,0,0,,－是，大老大！\N－是，大老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:46.33,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,老夫或許時日無多了……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.87,0:21:55.96,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,若那隻狸貓來不及做出解藥，\N而老夫變成了冰鬼……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:57.50,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,先為老夫做一件事！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.38,0:22:00.59,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,不要猶豫……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:03.93,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,一劍斬了老夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.55,0:22:07.18,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,否則……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.68,0:22:10.18,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,老夫會把你們全都斬殺……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.18,0:22:12.64,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,無論敵友，一個不留——
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.64,0:22:16.11,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,直到無人生還！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.90,0:22:18.36,Main-207+,Yatappe,0,0,0,,我們怎能……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:23.32,Main-207+,Cho,0,0,0,,可是……萬一大老大變成了冰鬼……
Comment: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:19.82,Main-207+,Cho,0,0,0,,But if Big Boss becomes an ice ogre...
Comment: 0,0:22:19.82,0:22:23.32,Main-207+,Cho,0,0,0,,But if Big Boss becomes an ice ogre...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:28.37,Main-207+,Cho,0,0,0,,就沒人能夠阻止他了……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.46,0:22:35.46,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,老夫就拜託你們了……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.79,0:22:39.09,Main-207+,Hotei,0,0,0,,那好……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.09,0:22:43.63,Main-207+,Hotei,0,0,0,,身為前見迴組的一員，\N倒想見識見識他的本事……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.09,0:22:47.80,Main-207+,Hotei,0,0,0,,你是什麼傳奇人物是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.18,0:22:50.68,Main-207+,Hotei,0,0,0,,在我看來不過是個過氣的劍客罷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.02,0:22:53.14,Main-207+,Hotei,0,0,0,,你這老不死！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.06,0:22:56.40,Main-207+,Hotei,0,0,0,,受死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.46,0:23:16.54,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}花之一刀流！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.06,0:23:32.56,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}炎髮……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.27,0:23:41.44,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}神聖之怒！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.22,0:24:09.84,Main-207+,Apoo,0,0,0,,用人海戰術淹沒他！上！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.23,0:24:19.81,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,御田啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.27,0:24:26.44,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,老夫有時會想……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.16,0:24:34.40,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,若我們當年……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.40,0:24:36.08,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,正值巔峰時就向凱多挑戰便好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.63,0:24:49.55,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,但如今……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.00,0:24:51.59,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,錦右衛門他們……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.59,0:24:54.56,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,完成了一場完美的突襲！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.14,0:24:59.35,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,不僅如此……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.89,0:25:03.44,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,老夫還收了個十分有趣的弟子！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.57,0:25:13.32,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,草帽大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.32,0:25:15.62,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,你潛力非凡。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.33,0:25:19.04,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,你會變得越來越強！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.54,0:25:21.12,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,記住這句話。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.12,0:25:22.67,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,在危機關頭……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.96,0:25:26.17,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,你真正的力量便會覺醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.18,0:25:35.60,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,讓我們一起打倒凱多吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.56,0:25:40.77,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,沒問題！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.10,0:25:43.61,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,用你教我的那招流櫻……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.44,0:25:48.15,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\t(2187,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}我要踢爆凱多的屁股！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.69,0:25:53.91,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,那番話裡沒有半分虛假，也沒有半分自負。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.28,0:25:58.29,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,老夫深信，他必能掌握流櫻，變得更加強大……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.62,0:26:02.08,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,最終打倒凱多！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.87,0:26:05.04,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,好好看著吧，御田！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.01,0:26:12.13,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,老夫打從心底相信，和之國這片土地……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.22,0:26:16.22,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,必將再次迎來黎明！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.47,0:26:20.23,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,哇喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.23,0:26:22.39,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,整層樓都要被清空了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.44,0:26:30.32,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,去見閻王吧，你這老糊塗！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.53,0:26:33.36,Main-207+,Marco,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}不死鳥烙印！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.91,0:26:43.96,Main-207+,Marco,0,0,0,,你最好盯緊我，Queen！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.79,0:26:47.67,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,瑪爾科！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.67,0:26:49.50,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.50,0:26:51.96,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,那是衝擊波之類的東西嗎，你這臭小子？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.26,0:26:54.97,Main-207+,Marco,0,0,0,,你現在的對手是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.97,0:26:58.39,Main-207+,Marco,0,0,0,,想專心去打那些武士……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.39,0:27:00.85,Main-207+,Marco,0,0,0,,先砍下我的頭再說！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.85,0:27:05.15,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,可惡！這傢伙就是死不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.61,0:27:10.53,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,快點下地獄去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.08,0:27:29.42,Main-207+,Marco,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}青鳥！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.69,0:27:54.07,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,這就了結你！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.49,0:27:56.40,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,你這王八蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.24,0:27:59.95,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,別得寸進尺！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.16,0:28:04.50,Main-207+,Marco,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鶴爪！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.34,0:28:26.73,Main-207+,Marco,0,0,0,,也難怪……要同時擋住兩個\N懸賞超過十億的傢伙可不輕鬆……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.65,0:28:35.07,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.25,0:28:49.79,Main-207+,Marco,0,0,0,,快點啊，狸貓……！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.63,0:28:58.47,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,咦？那邊那個是瑪爾科嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.47,0:29:01.59,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,看來他被狠狠地……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.89,0:29:04.39,Main-207+,Perospero,0,0,0,,修理了一頓。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.93,0:29:09.73,Main-207+,Samurai #1,0,0,0,,大家又都變回冰鬼了！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.73,0:29:12.06,Main-207+,Samurai #2,0,0,0,,火……火焰消失了……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.06,0:29:13.69,Main-207+,Samurai #2,0,0,0,,救救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.33,0:29:26.70,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,動手吧！這正是老夫所願！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.46,0:29:39.38,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,彷彿是上天賜予老夫的最後一份恩賞……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.92,0:29:43.82,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,老夫本在牢中腐朽，只待一死，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.82,0:29:45.60,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,卻一路撐到了這裡……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.52,0:29:56.69,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,然而，老夫若繼續活著，\N你們所有人都將性命難保！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.69,0:30:00.11,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,恕老夫將你們逼入這般境地……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.11,0:30:02.20,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,但你們務必為老夫動手！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.96,0:30:15.04,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,剩下的，就託付給你們\N代老夫繼續下去了……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.67,0:30:19.42,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,這名喚「花」豹五郎的男人……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.18,0:30:25.30,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,就此離開人世……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.14,0:30:28.48,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,死而無憾！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=11}===============================DIALOGUE============================
